{"id":"ws9-mn10","title":"ānāpānassati","titleEn":"Awareness of Breathing","ref":"MN 10 · excerpt","source":"Pāḷi Workshop booklet · page 95","credit":"Pāḷi text and English translation as in Mor’s Pāḷi Workshop booklet.","section":"extra","collection":"workshop","group":"9 · nirodhasacca & maggasacca","groupSub":"The Path and Its End","paras":[{"t":[["“"],["kathañ","kathañ"],[" "],["ca","ca"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhu","bhikkhu"],[" "],["kāye","kāye"],[" "],["kāy’ānupassī","kāy’ānupassī"],[" "],["viharati","viharati"],["?"],[" "],["idha","idha"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhu","bhikkhu"],[" "],["arañña-gato","arañña-gato"],[" "],["vā","vā"],[","],["\n"],["rukkha-mūla-gato","rukkha-mūla-gato"],[" "],["vā","vā"],[","],[" "],["suññ’āgāra-gato","suññ’āgāra-gato"],[" "],["vā","vā"],[" "],["nisīdati","nisīdati"],[";"],[" "],["pallaṅkaṃ","pallaṅkaṃ"],[" "],["ābhujitvā","ābhujitvā"],[","],[" "],["ujuṃ","ujuṃ"],[" "],["kāyaṃ","kāyaṃ"],[" "],["paṇidhāya","paṇidhāya"],[","],["\n"],["parimukhaṃ","parimukhaṃ"],[" "],["satiṃ","satiṃ"],[" "],["upaṭṭhapetvā","upaṭṭhapetvā"],[","],["\n"],["so","so"],[" "],["sato’va","sato’va"],[" "],["assasati","assasati"],[";"],[" "],["sato’va","sato’va"],[" "],["passasati","passasati"],["."]],"en":"“And how, bhikkhus, does a bhikkhu dwell observing body as body? Here a bhikkhu, gone to the forest or to the foot of a tree or to an empty hut, sits down;\nhaving folded his legs crosswise, set his body erect,\nand established awareness around the mouth,\njust aware, he breathes in; just aware, he breathes out.","lines":true},{"t":[["dīghaṃ","dīghaṃ"],[" "],["vā","vā"],[" "],["assasanto","assasanto"],[","],[" "],["‘"],["dīghaṃ","dīghaṃ"],[" "],["assasāmī’ti","assasāmī’ti"],[" "],["pajānāti","pajānāti"],[","],[" "],["dīghaṃ","dīghaṃ"],[" "],["vā","vā"],[" "],["passasanto","passasanto"],[","],[" "],["‘"],["dīghaṃ","dīghaṃ"],[" "],["passasāmī’ti","passasāmī’ti"],[" "],["pajānāti","pajānāti"],